WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.897 --> 00:00:02.020
KAMALA KHAN
Maybe they're right.

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.537
I spend too much
time in fantasy land.

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:07.886
Whoa.

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:09.676
BRUNO CARRELLI
What does it feel like?

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.770
KAMALA KHAN
I always thought I wanted

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.678
this kind of life.

00:00:13.664 --> 00:00:15.434
I never imagined any of this.

00:00:18.023 --> 00:00:19.056
AGENT SADIE DEEVER
Get them now.

00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:22.296
YUSUF KHAN
If you save one life...

00:00:23.399 --> 00:00:24.674
...you save the world.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.003
KAMALA KHAN
Cosmic.

